{
  "name": "Refund-dispute judge (Jev judge)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Replace with your dispute: the order, what the buyer says, what the seller can show.\nreturn [{ pairedItem: { item: 0 }, json: {\n  order: 'Order 1142: wireless headphones, 89 EUR, delivered 2026-09-20',\n  complaint: 'The left earbud does not charge. I want a refund.',\n  evidence: 'Carrier: delivered and signed 2026-09-20. Seller photo before shipping shows both earbuds at 100 %. No return has been opened.',\n} }];"
      },
      "name": "The dispute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "ask",
        "connection": "direct",
        "model": "jev-1.13.0",
        "questions": {},
        "questionsJson": "[{\"id\":\"defect_plausible\",\"kind\":\"noul\",\"text\":\"Given the order, the complaint and the evidence, is a defect on arrival plausible?\"},{\"id\":\"evidence_contradicts\",\"kind\":\"noul\",\"text\":\"Does the seller's evidence directly contradict the buyer's claim?\"}]",
        "routing": "{\"defect_plausible\":{\"gte\":0.7},\"evidence_contradicts\":{\"lte\":0.3}}",
        "replyLanguage": "off",
        "failClosed": true,
        "state": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
      },
      "name": "TypeSafe",
      "type": "@taifoon/n8n-nodes-typesafe.taifoonTypeSafe",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        420
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "taifoonTypeSafeApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TypeSafe API (your key from console.typesafe.ai)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Refund",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Deny, with the reason",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "A person decides",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        600
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Decide the easy disputes, route the rest\n\nTwo closed questions, each with a probability. Only a clear case leaves by **Refund** or **Deny**. Anything in between goes to **a person**, so no one is refused on a guess.\n\nTune the thresholds in **Routing**. Your own TypeSafe key only.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 240
      },
      "name": "How it works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
